        "description": "Key of the playback session"
      },
      "why": "https://github.com/pkkid/python-plexapi/blob/4.18.3/plexapi/base.py#L1039-L1047 — PlexSession reads the sessionKey attribute of every /status/sessions item; the official spec omits it. Typed string or integer: python-plexapi parses it from XML, the JSON type is not documented"
    },
