    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/paths/~1library~1sections~1all/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/MediaContainer/allOf/0",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "identifier": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "totalSize": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The total size of objects available.  Also provided in the X-Plex-Container-Total-Size header"
          },
          "offset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The offset of where this container page starts among the total objects available.  Also provided in the X-Plex-Container-Start header"
          }
        }
      },
      "why": "Upstream bug: this allOf references #/components/schemas/mediaContainer, which is the {MediaContainer: {...}} envelope, so identifier/size/totalSize/offset end up undeclared on the container itself; replaced by the envelope's inner MediaContainer schema"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/paths/~1status~1sessions/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/MediaContainer/allOf/0",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "identifier": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "totalSize": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The total size of objects available.  Also provided in the X-Plex-Container-Total-Size header"
          },
          "offset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The offset of where this container page starts among the total objects available.  Also provided in the X-Plex-Container-Start header"
          }
        }
      },
      "why": "properties-MediaContainer also declares Metadata items as $ref metadata; with unknown properties rejected (spec §Contract check) that branch would reject the session fields (User, Player, Session…) the sibling allOf member adds to the same items. Keeps the container fields only"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/parameters/mediaQuery/schema",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "integer"
          ]
        }
      },
      "why": "https://developer.plex.tv/pms/#section/API-Info/Media-Queries — the spec's own info.description: a media query is a set of `<field><operator>=<value>` query keys (e.g. type=4, addedAt>>=-7d) with string or integer values; the published schema (an object without properties) accepts none of them"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1status~1sessions~1history~1all/get/parameters/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "viewedAt>",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Only plays viewed at or after this epoch time (seconds)",
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "why": "https://github.com/pkkid/python-plexapi/blob/4.18.3/plexapi/server.py#L651-L675 — PlexServer.history(mindate=…) filters plays with the viewedAt> query key (epoch seconds); the spec only declares an exact viewedAt"
    },
