      "why": "https://github.com/pkkid/python-plexapi/blob/4.18.3/plexapi/server.py#L1012-L1016 and https://github.com/pkkid/python-plexapi/blob/4.18.3/plexapi/server.py#L1225-L1250 — PlexServer.resources() reads /statistics/resources?timespan=6 as StatisticsResources items (at, host/process CPU and memory utilization, timespan); absent from the official spec"
    },
